  "contentHtml": "<p id=\"block-2ddcfb5de8a54825a0062160f0111ca7\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">Lors de votre visite, vous aurez l'occasion de faire la rencontre de notre cheptel d’ânes et d’Eventy, notre cheval, mais également de Poncho et Morgane, respectivement alpaga et lama. Vous y entendrez Shiny et ses cocottes et vous pourrez apercevoir quelques chats câlins. Chacun.e d'eux contribue à la vie et à l'énergie de 4 Sources et nous sommes ravi.es de partager leur présence avec vous.</p><h1 id=\"block-bce6e56ac30f4e0ab2c13c3ba60cf84c\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Les ânes des 4 Sources 🐎</h1><div id=\"block-2950d1493317807f8414f724d2d6dbe5\" class=\"notion-callout bg-brown-light border\"><div class=\"notion-callout__content\"><span class=\"notion-semantic-string\"></span><div id=\"block-2950d14933178061a444e95c0885a24b\" class=\"notion-collection inline\"><div class=\"notion-collection-gallery no-border-top medium\"><div id=\"block-2950d14933178023aa06fddb228afa57\" class=\"notion-collection-card gallery\"><a id=\"block-2950d14933178023aa06fddb228afa57\" href=\"/2950d14933178023aa06fddb228afa57\" class=\"notion-link notion-collection-card__anchor\" data-link-uri=\"/2950d14933178023aa06fddb228afa57\"></a><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/46c2aec5-908c-48d5-bb09-058258f2545b/20240526_080043_CE1C4F21/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/46c2aec5-908c-48d5-bb09-058258f2545b/20240526_080043_CE1C4F21/public\"><img alt=\"item\" class=\"notion-collection-card__cover medium\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/46c2aec5-908c-48d5-bb09-058258f2545b/20240526_080043_CE1C4F21/public\"></span><div class=\"notion-collection-card__content notion-collection-card__property-list\"><div class=\"notion-property notion-property__title notion-collection-card__property title notion-semantic-string\"></div></div></div><div id=\"block-2950d149331780098a45cf1a675b22ad\" class=\"notion-collection-card gallery\"><a id=\"block-2950d149331780098a45cf1a675b22ad\" href=\"/2950d149331780098a45cf1a675b22ad\" class=\"notion-link notion-collection-card__anchor\" data-link-uri=\"/2950d149331780098a45cf1a675b22ad\"></a><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/23e0c9fd-2a33-4754-a2cf-20f42934b344/20250713_204424_A72DB70C/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/23e0c9fd-2a33-4754-a2cf-20f42934b344/20250713_204424_A72DB70C/public\"><img alt=\"item\" class=\"notion-collection-card__cover medium\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/23e0c9fd-2a33-4754-a2cf-20f42934b344/20250713_204424_A72DB70C/public\"></span><div class=\"notion-collection-card__content notion-collection-card__property-list\"><div class=\"notion-property notion-property__title notion-collection-card__property title notion-semantic-string\"></div></div></div><div id=\"block-2950d1493317807988a5ddaecbf8871e\" class=\"notion-collection-card gallery\"><a id=\"block-2950d1493317807988a5ddaecbf8871e\" href=\"/2950d1493317807988a5ddaecbf8871e\" class=\"notion-link notion-collection-card__anchor\" data-link-uri=\"/2950d1493317807988a5ddaecbf8871e\"></a><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/172f3b1e-b14b-43df-a396-b81f922773b6/b434ee2f-a0ee-4f3b-811b-2e730900371c/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/172f3b1e-b14b-43df-a396-b81f922773b6/b434ee2f-a0ee-4f3b-811b-2e730900371c/public\"><img alt=\"item\" class=\"notion-collection-card__cover medium\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/172f3b1e-b14b-43df-a396-b81f922773b6/b434ee2f-a0ee-4f3b-811b-2e730900371c/public\"></span><div class=\"notion-collection-card__content notion-collection-card__property-list\"><div class=\"notion-property notion-property__title notion-collection-card__property title notion-semantic-string\"></div></div></div><div id=\"block-2950d149331780059b36f15c4e45700d\" class=\"notion-collection-card gallery\"><a id=\"block-2950d149331780059b36f15c4e45700d\" href=\"/2950d149331780059b36f15c4e45700d\" class=\"notion-link notion-collection-card__anchor\" data-link-uri=\"/2950d149331780059b36f15c4e45700d\"></a><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/b521af85-f189-4b66-9f01-185ab5feb4bf/c3a9c2f7-846b-4a9e-b758-ca485b90b588/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/b521af85-f189-4b66-9f01-185ab5feb4bf/c3a9c2f7-846b-4a9e-b758-ca485b90b588/public\"><img alt=\"item\" class=\"notion-collection-card__cover medium\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/b521af85-f189-4b66-9f01-185ab5feb4bf/c3a9c2f7-846b-4a9e-b758-ca485b90b588/public\"></span><div class=\"notion-collection-card__content notion-collection-card__property-list\"><div class=\"notion-property notion-property__title notion-collection-card__property title notion-semantic-string\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><p id=\"block-ed38742473664e869c245fc6b2863c1c\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">Nous partageons les espaces avec 26 ânes qui passent d’une prairie à l’autre au fil des saisons. \nCe sont des partenaires d’entretien des pâtures incroyables qui œuvrent 7 jours sur 7, 24h sur 24h.</p><h1 id=\"block-7397e197561a4b5fbbfbeee6321c32bc\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Eventy, the one and only one cheval 🐴</h1><div id=\"block-c78fd5f8f3634493bb46d330042e1758\" class=\"notion-image page-width\"><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/252e2370-a14d-4058-867a-c2e9cbb2cf76/212954fa-858e-4082-a12b-187517a41669/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/252e2370-a14d-4058-867a-c2e9cbb2cf76/212954fa-858e-4082-a12b-187517a41669/public\"><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/252e2370-a14d-4058-867a-c2e9cbb2cf76/212954fa-858e-4082-a12b-187517a41669/public\"></span></div><h1 id=\"block-f5369571390a45dd87b64e9ffc6ce16f\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Poncho et Morgane 🦙</h1><p id=\"block-3581a064d41b4922bd286bfcf27a5ff0\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">En liberté sur le lieu après avoir vécu dans un refuge, ils font partie des mascottes des 4 Sources. Ne vous étonnez pas si vous les croisez sur la terrasse, leur bac de nourriture se trouve juste derrière le bar.</p><div id=\"block-3326dc1e67bc4839b0bb461d84fed190\" class=\"notion-image page-width\"><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/f75e17ac-e962-477d-882d-a0baa0f8b8d8/7fe5b9dd-6ed7-4df3-abf7-7fb1d1066117/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/f75e17ac-e962-477d-882d-a0baa0f8b8d8/7fe5b9dd-6ed7-4df3-abf7-7fb1d1066117/public\"><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/f75e17ac-e962-477d-882d-a0baa0f8b8d8/7fe5b9dd-6ed7-4df3-abf7-7fb1d1066117/public\"></span></div><p id=\"block-6974b96857834ea0a59d6d01b38d25f7\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">Poncho et Morgane sur un bon lit de paille fraiche</p><div id=\"block-1380910565464b519ca08d392cdc6f70\" class=\"notion-image page-width\"><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/8b1741c2-9b4f-496e-88d8-da4c40a521ca/c2427917-11a9-4b42-a0cb-69ac38705e1e/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/8b1741c2-9b4f-496e-88d8-da4c40a521ca/c2427917-11a9-4b42-a0cb-69ac38705e1e/public\"><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/8b1741c2-9b4f-496e-88d8-da4c40a521ca/c2427917-11a9-4b42-a0cb-69ac38705e1e/public\"></span></div><h1 id=\"block-573780d977cf4dd3847c97d50f9bde56\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Les poules et Shiny 🐔</h1><p id=\"block-b32e6507881f450898b96c4f0c61ddde\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">Nous avons 14 poules et un coq, Shiny. Vous ne pourrez pas le manquer si vous logez sur place, au moins à l’oreille, un vrai tenor !</p><div id=\"block-f9bffe92bcd545aba9d10dd078e23c62\" class=\"notion-column-list\"><div id=\"block-1ce08d5ee63f4f74a6cf982d75a90336\" class=\"notion-column\" data-width=\"50%\"><div id=\"block-ed286a0b731646fc921dcd4f5defac3e\" class=\"notion-image align-start page-width\"><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/80a41e99-d295-4912-940a-801d0d5d5fa4/74cf2281-4092-426c-916f-595aaf3c51ed/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/80a41e99-d295-4912-940a-801d0d5d5fa4/74cf2281-4092-426c-916f-595aaf3c51ed/public\"><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/80a41e99-d295-4912-940a-801d0d5d5fa4/74cf2281-4092-426c-916f-595aaf3c51ed/public\"></span></div></div><div id=\"block-2cd01e82db264bbd81a9c3894e9e5032\" class=\"notion-column\" data-width=\"50%\"><div id=\"block-28ee05a11ccd47a8b1b4dc3f5c361d99\" class=\"notion-image align-start page-width\"><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/a59d4cce-d786-4231-ba90-3c744ef2e9b2/282f9574-a2ba-4f82-91fc-9b5d86266d75/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/a59d4cce-d786-4231-ba90-3c744ef2e9b2/282f9574-a2ba-4f82-91fc-9b5d86266d75/public\"><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/a59d4cce-d786-4231-ba90-3c744ef2e9b2/282f9574-a2ba-4f82-91fc-9b5d86266d75/public\"></span></div></div></div><h1 id=\"block-3733a921b0a44791ac191587dc83f8bc\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Les chats 🐈</h1><p id=\"block-43ba52d4cf3f439d93b733d5753fa0c7\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\">Douceurs et câlins au programme avec les chats des 4 Sources…</p><div id=\"block-05f979baf58a474c9f3689b8a51ec8d4\" class=\"notion-image page-width\"><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/a77952da-432e-441b-90c8-207c62cc1620/20f4b391-aa88-4223-8efb-7dd7e38c39d0/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/a77952da-432e-441b-90c8-207c62cc1620/20f4b391-aa88-4223-8efb-7dd7e38c39d0/public\"><img alt=\"Tigresse\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/a77952da-432e-441b-90c8-207c62cc1620/20f4b391-aa88-4223-8efb-7dd7e38c39d0/public\"></span><figcaption class=\"notion-caption notion-semantic-string\">Tigresse</figcaption></div><h1 id=\"block-680a56eea47144d9a249c96ce583531f\" class=\"notion-heading notion-semantic-string\">Mais aussi, en guest stars…</h1><div id=\"block-77b315fd054d407ab92305f1077ed3ec\" class=\"notion-column-list\"><div id=\"block-4a1c70bc236e46149a7a00f55f82fcc3\" class=\"notion-column\" data-width=\"50%\"><div id=\"block-9e42e42e663b47f1a79c84dd0a208463\" class=\"notion-image align-start page-width\"><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/ba04c648-c9e1-4ab5-ba20-419a13796fcb/1f4f778c-159c-49ec-bcaa-a09de058d9e3/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/ba04c648-c9e1-4ab5-ba20-419a13796fcb/1f4f778c-159c-49ec-bcaa-a09de058d9e3/public\"><img alt=\"La fête aux crapauds\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/ba04c648-c9e1-4ab5-ba20-419a13796fcb/1f4f778c-159c-49ec-bcaa-a09de058d9e3/public\"></span><figcaption class=\"notion-caption notion-semantic-string\">La fête aux crapauds</figcaption></div></div><div id=\"block-7e1dcdf43a1d465ab8ceeb9a9458ea98\" class=\"notion-column\" data-width=\"50%\"><div id=\"block-63985290c59045758d4ffffba1139ca2\" class=\"notion-image align-start page-width\"><span data-full-size=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/774fd516-4369-4cb1-8550-292141dbcf48/ed3393f1-c35e-4715-a19e-5395ad73399d/public\" data-lightbox-src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/774fd516-4369-4cb1-8550-292141dbcf48/ed3393f1-c35e-4715-a19e-5395ad73399d/public\"><img alt=\"Les magnifiques salamandres\" src=\"https://images.spr.so/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/j42No7y-dcokJuNgXeA0ig/774fd516-4369-4cb1-8550-292141dbcf48/ed3393f1-c35e-4715-a19e-5395ad73399d/public\"></span><figcaption class=\"notion-caption notion-semantic-string\">Les magnifiques salamandres</figcaption></div></div></div><p id=\"block-a80167d4e7ca447089059ade0cec1794\" class=\"notion-text notion-text__content notion-semantic-string\"><span class=\"highlighted-background bg-yellow\">→ </span><span class=\"highlighted-background bg-yellow\"><a href=\"/biodiversite\" class=\"notion-link link\" data-link-uri=\"/biodiversite\">Plus de détails sur la biodiversité aux 4 Sources</a></span></p>",
